    - rid: 1000
      type: {class: BtRoot, ns: CGD.BehaviorTrees, asm: CGD.Runtime}
      data:
        _guid: 213b2e7280164c24814747e4fd84e203
        _position: {x: 0, y: 0}
        _comment: 'A support unit (engineer, medic, broodkeeper — any faction): keeps out of reach, repairs the most damaged ally nearby (Kit › Support, e.g. Field Repair), deploys what its Summon calls up (Kit › Summon: turrets, drones), and otherwise shoots from cover.'
